class Resource extends Base {
 mount(){this.commands??=[{id:'new-project',label:'Create a new project',group:'Workspace',shortcut:'N'},{id:'find-project',label:'Find a project',group:'Workspace',shortcut:'F'},{id:'recent-files',label:'Open recent files',group:'Workspace',shortcut:'R'},{id:'appearance',label:'Change appearance',group:'Preferences',shortcut:'T'},{id:'keyboard',label:'Keyboard shortcuts',group:'Preferences',shortcut:'?'},{id:'export',label:'Export workspace',group:'Actions',shortcut:'E'},{id:'invite',label:'Invite a collaborator',group:'Actions',shortcut:'I'}];this.instanceId=uid();this.active=0;this.render(`<section class="launch panel"><span class="label">LESS SEARCHING. MORE MAKING.</span><h2>One good shortcut.</h2><p class="hint">Projects, preferences and your next action.<br>Find the thing you came here to do.</p><button class="primary trigger" aria-haspopup="dialog">${escape(this.text('label','Open command palette'))}<kbd>⌘ K</kbd></button><div class="last"><span class="pip"></span><span data-result>No command selected yet.</span></div></section><dialog aria-labelledby="${this.instanceId}-title"><header class="row between"><h3 id="${this.instanceId}-title">Where to next?</h3><button class="close" aria-label="Close command palette">×</button></header><div class="search"><span>⌕</span><input type="search" aria-label="Search commands" role="combobox" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="${this.instanceId}-list" placeholder="Search a command…" autocomplete="off"/></div><div class="results" role="listbox" id="${this.instanceId}-list" aria-label="Commands"></div><footer><span><kbd>↑</kbd><kbd>↓</kbd> navigate</span><span><kbd>↵</kbd> choose</span><span><kbd>esc</kbd> close</span></footer></dialog>`,`.launch{min-height:450px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;align-items:flex-start;padding:42px;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%,#c6e6b011,transparent 60%),var(--bg)}h2{font:400 clamp(31px,5vw,48px) Georgia;letter-spacing:-1.8px;margin:17px 0}.launch>.hint{font-size:13px;line-height:1.9}.trigger{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;margin:28px 0 26px;min-width:260px}.trigger kbd{border-color:#203e2630;color:#263e2b}.last{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}.pip{width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent)}dialog{width:540px}dialog h3{font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.search{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:17px 22px}.search>span{font-size:23px;color:var(--muted)}.search input{width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;padding:9px 0;outline:none}.results{max-height:310px;overflow-y:auto;padding:0 10px 10px}.group{padding:11px 12px 6px;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}.option{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:12px;border-radius:7px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer}.option[aria-selected=true]{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 12%,var(--panel));color:var(--accent)}.option em{font-style:normal;margin-right:9px;color:var(--muted)}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px 20px;display:flex;gap:21px;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted)}footer kbd{margin-right:4px}@media(max-width:480px){.launch{padding:30px 24px;min-height:430px}.trigger{min-width:0;width:100%;gap:15px}footer{gap:12px;font-size:8px}.option{font-size:12px}}`);
 const dialog=this.$('dialog');this.setupDialog(dialog,this.$('.trigger'));this.listen(this.$('.trigger'),'click',()=>this.open());this.listen(this.$('.close'),'click',()=>this.close());this.listen(this.$('input'),'input',()=>{this.active=0;this.filter();});this.listen(this.$('input'),'keydown',e=>{if(['ArrowDown','ArrowUp'].includes(e.key)){e.preventDefault();this.active=(this.active+(e.key==='ArrowDown'?1:-1)+this.filtered.length)%Math.max(1,this.filtered.length);this.highlight();}if(e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();this.choose(this.active);}});this.listen(this.$('.results'),'pointermove',e=>{const option=e.target.closest('[data-option]');if(option){this.active=Number(option.dataset.option);this.highlight();}});this.listen(this.$('.results'),'click',e=>{const option=e.target.closest('[data-option]');if(option)this.choose(Number(option.dataset.option));});this.listen(document,'keydown',e=>{if(e.defaultPrevented||!(e.metaKey||e.ctrlKey)||e.key.toLowerCase()!=='k')return;const active=document.activeElement;if(active?.localName===this.localName&&active!==this)return;e.preventDefault();dialog.open?this.close():this.open();});this.filter();}
 configured(name){if(name==='label')this.$('.trigger').firstChild.textContent=this.text('label','Open command palette');}
 open(){const dialog=this.$('dialog');if(!dialog.open){this.dialogTrigger=this.$('.trigger');dialog.showModal();}this.$('input').value='';this.active=0;this.filter();this.$('input').focus();}
 close(){this.$('dialog').close();}
 filter(){const query=this.$('input').value.trim().toLowerCase();const score=label=>{const text=label.toLowerCase();if(!query)return 1;if(text.includes(query))return 200-text.indexOf(query);let cursor=0,points=0;for(const ch of query){const index=text.indexOf(ch,cursor);if(index<0)return-1;points+=20-(index-cursor);cursor=index+1;}return points;};this.filtered=this.commands.map(c=>({...c,score:score(c.label)})).filter(c=>c.score>=0).sort((a,b)=>b.score-a.score);let last='';this.$('.results').innerHTML=this.filtered.length?this.filtered.map((c,i)=>{const group=c.group||'Commands';const heading=group!==last?`<div class="group" role="presentation">${escape(group)}</div>`:'';last=group;return`${heading}<div class="option" data-option="${i}" id="${this.instanceId}-${i}" role="option" aria-selected="${i===this.active}"><span><em>↗</em>${escape(c.label)}</span>${c.shortcut?`<kbd>${escape(c.shortcut)}</kbd>`:''}</div>`;}).join(''):'<div class="empty" role="presentation">No commands match. Try another word.</div>';this.highlight();}
 highlight(){const options=this.$$('[role=option]');options.forEach((o,i)=>o.setAttribute('aria-selected',String(i===this.active)));const node=options[this.active];if(node){this.$('input').setAttribute('aria-activedescendant',node.id);node.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}else this.$('input').removeAttribute('aria-activedescendant');}
 choose(index){const command=this.filtered[index];if(!command)return;this.$('[data-result]').textContent=`Last command: ${command.label}`;this.close();this.emit('command-select',{id:command.id,label:command.label});}
 teardown(){this.$('dialog')?.close();}
}
